    INN003 -.->|restore| RESTORE
    RESTORE -.->|可选加入<br/>新轮次| R3

    subgraph Storage[".brainstorm/ 目录结构"]
        direction LR
        P["path.json<br/>元数据·边·当前节点"]
        N["nodes/<br/>round-1.json<br/>round-2.json<br/>round-3.json"]
        S["snapshots/<br/>round-1-innovations.json<br/>..."]
        BR["branches/<br/>branch-1/"]
    end
    class Storage dir
    class P,N,S,BR dir

    R3 -.->|持久化| P
    R3 -.->|快照| N
